    {
      "id": "21526490",
      "title": "Handling the \"No Data\" State",
      "lectureOrder": 162,
      "videoOrder": 140,
      "sourceHash": "61b0404322be887bf2d6c7a4cf28845dec272a685d5a5c9365fe6cc60d356eb7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 5.33,
          "en": "At the moment we assume, that everything is going to work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.33,
          "end": 7.97,
          "en": "that we never getting any error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.97,
          "end": 11.64,
          "en": "But of course in reality, we could be getting an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.64,
          "end": 14.45,
          "en": "So therefore beside checking this loading state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.45,
          "end": 17.44,
          "en": "I also wanna check whether we get data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.44,
          "end": 20.78,
          "en": "and because we might not get an error and still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.78,
          "end": 24.35,
          "en": "not get any data, for example if we got no data here on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.35,
          "end": 27.023,
          "en": "Firebase, if I delete all of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.19,
          "end": 31.75,
          "en": "then we can send a successful request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.75,
          "end": 35.39,
          "en": "But it will get an empty response, because there is no data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.39,
          "end": 37.49,
          "en": "to be loaded so we wanna handle that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.49,
          "end": 40.73,
          "en": "And thereafter I also wanna handle real errors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.73,
          "end": 43.687,
          "en": "where the server times out, we have server site error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.687,
          "end": 45.4,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.4,
          "end": 47.563,
          "en": "But let's start with the no data case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.57,
          "end": 52.6,
          "en": "We are setting our data here, to the results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.6,
          "end": 55.85,
          "en": "and in the end handling the no data case is easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.85,
          "end": 59.25,
          "en": "Will simply not be able to loop through any data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.25,
          "end": 62.06,
          "en": "and therefore results will stay an empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.06,
          "end": 65.05,
          "en": "So in this case, we should check not just if",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.05,
          "end": 66.66,
          "en": "we loading or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.66,
          "end": 68.31,
          "en": "But here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.31,
          "end": 71.809,
          "en": "with \"else-if\" maybe I wanna check if we not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.809,
          "end": 73.06,
          "en": "loading...",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.06,
          "end": 74.825,
          "en": "but that we do have data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.825,
          "end": 78.003,
          "en": "were the length is greater than zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.16,
          "end": 81.24,
          "en": "If length is equal to zero its an",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.24,
          "end": 83.843,
          "en": "empty array and that simply means we have no data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 87.913,
          "en": "And of course its not data but results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.883,
          "end": 91.32,
          "en": "So if results length is greater than zero we could also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.32,
          "end": 94.49000000000001,
          "en": "add an extra check, and check if we have a true feed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.49000000000001,
          "end": 97.82300000000001,
          "en": "results value before we try diving into the length.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.75,
          "end": 101.85,
          "en": "Here we always have results, but in other apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.85,
          "end": 104.82,
          "en": "that might not even be set if you fail to load data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.82,
          "end": 107.10300000000001,
          "en": "Hence checking this as well could make sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.97,
          "end": 111.38300000000001,
          "en": "Then here we could add another paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.93,
          "end": 117.763,
          "en": "where we say: \"No stored experiences found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.00999999999999,
          "end": 120.12,
          "en": "Start adding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.12,
          "end": 122.253,
          "en": "some survey results,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.31,
          "end": 124.56,
          "en": "first.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.56,
          "end": 126.31,
          "en": "And I wanna show this paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.998,
          "end": 129.61,
          "en": "\"if\" or \"v-else-if\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.61,
          "end": 131.358,
          "en": "where not loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.358,
          "end": 134.22,
          "en": "but we don't have results,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.22,
          "end": 137.06,
          "en": "or and therefore that should go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.06,
          "end": 139.68,
          "en": "between brackets so that these two statements are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 139.68,
          "end": 143.31,
          "en": "evaluated together, or we do have results but the length is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.31,
          "end": 144.353,
          "en": "equal to zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.04,
          "end": 148.574,
          "en": "So for not loading, but we don't have results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.574,
          "end": 151.72,
          "en": "or our results length is equal to zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.72,
          "end": 156.07,
          "en": "then I wanna show this \"No stored experiences found\" text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.07,
          "end": 160.273,
          "en": "Otherwise, I will check this and show my actual results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.15,
          "end": 164.56,
          "en": "If we save that and reload, we see loading and then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.56,
          "end": 167.03,
          "en": "our no data message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.03,
          "end": 169.253,
          "en": "If I start submitting data though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.36,
          "end": 173.97,
          "en": "and then load the submitted experiences we see that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.97,
          "end": 176.66,
          "en": "So now we handling the no data case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.66,
          "end": 178.44299999999998,
          "en": "But what about real errors?",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
